{
  "title": [
    "If Your Nose Turns Pale",
    "Or The Pain Won't Ease",
    "After A Filler Injection —",
    "3 Warning Signs Of Vascular Occlusion"
  ],
  "eyebrow": "Nose Filler Warning Signs",
  "cover_char_file": "필러주사기_illust.jpg",
  "cover_scrim_color": "#7209B7",
  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Why This Happens",
      "char_file": "필러주사기_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Nose vessels sit close",
        "to the artery that",
        "supplies your eye",
        "",
        "If filler blocks one,",
        "blood flow stops and",
        "tissue loses oxygen"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Warning Sign 1: Pain That Won't Ease",
      "char_file": "필러주사기_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Pain that starts right",
        "after the procedure",
        "and keeps getting worse",
        "",
        "Normal bruising eases —",
        "this doesn't"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Warning Sign 2: Changing Skin Color",
      "char_file": "피부발진_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Turns pale first, then",
        "within hours shifts to",
        "a mottled purplish tone",
        "",
        "Slow change, easy to",
        "mistake for a bruise"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Warning Sign 3: The Golden Window",
      "char_file": "시계_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Tissue can only survive",
        "without oxygen for",
        "a few hours",
        "",
        "Waiting even a day makes",
        "recovery far harder"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "If Pain Won't Ease, Go Now",
      "char_file": "필러주사기_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "If the area stays pale",
        "and the pain won't ease",
        "",
        "Don't wait — contact your",
        "provider or go to",
        "urgent care immediately"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Ask About Ultrasound Guidance",
      "char_file": "필러주사기_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Before getting filler,",
        "ask whether the clinic",
        "uses ultrasound guidance",
        "",
        "It helps avoid",
        "injecting into vessels"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Choose A Clinic Ready For Emergencies",
      "char_file": "필러주사기_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Ask if they keep",
        "hyaluronidase on hand",
        "for emergencies",
        "",
        "That's the clearest way",
        "to stay safe"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "closing": {
